  "where-money-comes-from": {
   "id": "where-money-comes-from",
   "title": "Where money comes from",
   "summary": "From the central bank to your account: how money is created, layered and destroyed.",
   "area": "Money & Liquidity",
   "adv": false,
   "order": 1.0,
   "lanes": [
    "Who creates it",
    "Whose liability",
    "What can break"
   ],
   "intro": "<p>One dollar followed from the base of the system to your account and back. Each step adds a layer of promise on top of the one below.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Key rule:</strong> each step up the chain is a new promise, made by a new party. Each one is a place the chain can break.</p>\n</blockquote>",
   "outro": "<h2>What to notice</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Most of the money you see was created by a <strong>bank loan</strong>, not printed by the government.</li>\n<li>Final settlement between banks always happens in <strong>central bank money</strong>, the base layer of the <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#/map/p/hierarchy-of-money\" data-page=\"hierarchy-of-money\">hierarchy of money</a>.</li>\n<li>Repaying loans <strong>destroys</strong> money, which is why credit busts shrink the money supply.</li>\n</ul>",
   "steps": [
    {
     "label": "Central bank buys a bond",
     "page": "central-bank-money",
     "cells": [
      "Central bank",
      "Central bank (reserves)",
      "Trust in the currency; inflation"
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Bank lends to a borrower",
     "page": "money-creation",
     "cells": [
      "Commercial bank",
      "Bank (new deposit)",
      "Bad loans; bank failure"
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Borrower pays you",
     "page": "bank-deposits",
     "cells": [
      "— (deposit moves)",
      "Your bank",
      "Bank run; freeze"
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Your bank settles with theirs",
     "page": "central-bank-money",
     "cells": [
      "— (reserves move)",
      "Central bank",
      "— (final settlement)"
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "You withdraw notes",
     "page": "cash-and-fiat",
     "cells": [
      "Central bank",
      "Central bank (notes)",
      "Theft; inflation"
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Loan is repaid",
     "page": "money-creation",
     "cells": [
      "—",
      "— (deposit destroyed)",
      "—"
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
